('Karela Pyaz Sabzi + Toor Dal + 1 Multigrain Roti', 'North Indian', ARRAY['lunch'], 'lacto_vegetarian', '100g bitter gourd + 150g dal + 40g roti', 290, 385, 15, 50, 11, 12, 38, 'Bitter gourd contains charantin and polypeptide-p to assist post-meal blood glucose disposal.', 'sa_lunch_plate'),
