('Maharashtrian Sprouted Matki Usal + 1 Jowar Bhakri', 'Maharashtrian', ARRAY['lunch'], 'lacto_vegetarian', '180g moth bean usal + 45g jowar bhakri', 225, 380, 16, 56, 11, 9, 45, 'Sprouting moth beans lowers net digestible starch while boosting bioavailable B-vitamins.', 'si_lunch_plate'),
('Multigrain Thalipeeth + Plain Curd', 'Maharashtrian', ARRAY['breakfast','lunch'], 'lacto_vegetarian', '2 spiced multigrain flatbreads (120g) + 100g curd', 220, 390, 16, 49, 9, 14, 45, 'Roasted bhajani flour combines pulses and millets with coriander seeds for a slow-release carb profile.', 'si_breakfast'),
