('Brown Rice Bisi Bele Bath with Drumstick & Vegetables', 'South Indian', ARRAY['lunch'], 'lacto_vegetarian', '240g lentil-vegetable-brown rice bowl', 240, 410, 14, 58, 11, 13, 49, 'Organic acids in tamarind and soluble fiber in toor dal slow pancreatic starch breakdown.', 'si_lunch_plate'),
('Cucumber-Carrot Probiotic Curd Rice + Pomegranate', 'South Indian', ARRAY['dinner','lunch'], 'lacto_vegetarian', '200g 50/50 veggie-parboiled curd rice + 20g anar', 220, 295, 11, 36, 4, 11, 48, 'Replacing half the rice volume with grated cucumber and carrot cuts net carbs by 45%.', 'si_dinner_plate'),
